    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Scrape del endpoint",
      "description": "Prometheus pudo leer el endpoint de métricas de CrowdSec (1 = sí). No prueba que esté leyendo logs: eso lo muestran las líneas leídas y el ratio de parseo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "up{job=\"crowdsec\"}",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "sin scrape",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": [
            {
              "type": "value",
              "options": {
                "0": {
                  "text": "DOWN",
                  "color": "red",
                  "index": 0
                },
                "1": {
                  "text": "UP",
                  "color": "green",
                  "index": 1
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Último heartbeat (s)",
      "description": "Segundos desde el último heartbeat del agente a la LAPI. Si crece mientras el scrape responde, el agente está desincronizado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "time() - max(cs_machines_last_heartbeat_timestamp{job=\"crowdsec\"})",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "sin heartbeat",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 120
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 300
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Líneas leídas (período)",
      "description": "Incremento estimado de líneas leídas por la adquisición Loki. Tolera reinicios. Contrastar con count_over_time() en Loki: si difiere mucho, la adquisición no lee todo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(cs_lokisource_hits_total{job=\"crowdsec\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0 — sin serie",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Ratio de parseo",
      "description": "Líneas parseadas OK sobre el total que llegó a los parsers (ok + ko). No es leídas/procesadas: ese cociente compara denominadores distintos. Sin serie significa que no hubo líneas, no que el parser esté roto.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(cs_parser_hits_ok_total{job=\"crowdsec\"}[$__range])) / sum(increase(cs_parser_hits_total{job=\"crowdsec\"}[$__range]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "noValue": "sin líneas",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.9
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "decimals": 1
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Latencia LAPI p95",
      "description": "p95 del tiempo de respuesta de la LAPI. Incluye solo llamadas locales del agente y, si hubiera, de bouncers. No mide la latencia del sitio.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 1,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(cs_lapi_request_duration_seconds_bucket{job=\"crowdsec\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "refId": "A",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "noValue": "sin serie",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
